IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ho grosse novità!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Presto me ne vado da questa città!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sì, volevo partire d'estate, ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
In fondo è sempre meglio fare
domani quello che puoi fare oggi!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Se aspetto l'inverno, però, va a
finire che non mi decido più. Ho
già cominciato a salutare tutti.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Partirò il giorno {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} di questo mese.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ma fino ad allora dovrai
sopportarmi!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000F000000}}
Non trasferirti!
È il momento giusto.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Tengo un secretito!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Iba a
callármelo, pero creo que a ti sí te
lo puedo contar.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Me voy en verano.
{{TAG:0003:002A:}}¡Ji, ji!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Si mi vida fuera un libro,
lo podrías llamar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡"La locura de {{TAG:0005:0001:}}"!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tierras extrañas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} frutas exóticas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
fiestas locas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} peinados nuevos{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Todo eso me está esperando!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¡Ya puedes imaginártelo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Pues eso,
que me he decidido. Me iré del
pueblo antes de que pase el verano.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡No falta nada!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Pero no te librarás
de mí hasta el {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} de este mes.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
¡Piénsatelo mejor!
Buena suerte...

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}J'voulais garder ça secret, mais...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
pour toi, j'vais faire une exception.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Voilà :{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} j'me casse d'ici.
{{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hi hi !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Si on écrivait un bouquin sur
moi, y s'appellerait sûrement :{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}, ouf et fière de l'être !
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Des bourre-pifs à foison,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} des pays
inconnus,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} des fruits zarbi... {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Voilà
comment j'imagine ma nouvelle vie !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bref, tu vois l'tableau !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} De toute
façon, ma décision est prise. J'aurai
filé avant la fin d'l'été.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Le {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} de ce mois-ci pour être
précise.{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
Reconsidère !
Amuse-toi bien...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ho un segreto...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Cioè, volevo che
fosse un segreto, ma non so quanto
ancora posso restare zitta...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quest'estate mi trasferisco! {{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ihih!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Se ci fosse una biografia su di me, si
chiamerebbe "{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}} la pazza"!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Gente nuova,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} terre sconosciute,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
frutti esotici,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} arte d'avanguardia{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Il mondo là fuori mi aspetta!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Mi capisci, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Beh, comunque
ho già deciso. Lascio la città
prima della fine dell'estate.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Manca poco, in realtà{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Dovrai
sopportarmi fino al giorno {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}}
di questo mese.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000F000000}}
Ripensaci!
Buona fortuna...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oye, una amiga me ha contado algo
increíble de su pueblo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Hacen
fiestas de 24 horas!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡TODO EL DÍA DE FIESTA!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Y
toda la noche!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Y no me avisan?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Yo a eso me apunto ahora mismo!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Pero claro, aún tengo unas
facturitas que pagar...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} En cuanto
quede todo saldado, ¡yo me piro!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mira que no quería tener muchas
ataduras, ¡pero tengo que pagar
mis clases de {{TAG:0005:0012:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Pues eso, que me voy.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Me piro
del pueblo. {{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Me largo el {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}}
de este mes!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hasta entonces supongo que me
verás por ahí, pagando deudas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡y muerta de ganas de irme!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
¡No te vayas!
¡Hala, vete a la fiesta!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Un mio amico di un'altra città mi ha
raccontato una storia assurda{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Dice che lì i cittadini si organizzano
in bande di strada! {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ti rendi conto?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
A quanto pare è una cosa seria!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}E noi qui ad ammuffire in questa
noiosa città!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Siamo proprio tagliati
fuori dal mondo!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Io non posso più restare.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Voglio
andare dove si vive per davvero,
dove si fa la storia!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Parto il giorno {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} di questo mese.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Fino ad allora mi vedrai in giro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma
poi non mi guarderò più indietro.{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000F000000}}
Non farlo!
Vai pure!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ah, sei tu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sai che presto trasloco?
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Volevo andarmene d'estate, ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
rimandare è il mio secondo nome!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}A un certo punto però mi son detta:
o adesso, o mai più.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Quindi...
adesso!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi sono anche data una scadenza:
il giorno {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} del mese prossimo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Devi sopportarmi ancora un po'!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000F000000}}
Ti prego, resta!
In bocca al lupo.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Stehste gut?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Ich{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Also, ich
verdrück mich von hier.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Jap.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ich zieh hier weg!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich kann ja schließlich nich' mein
ganzes Leben hier in {{TAG:0005:0006:}}
versauern{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ich hab noch sooo viel vor!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001C:}}So viele
Abenteuer warten nur auf mich!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das verstehste doch sicher, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}oder?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Jedenfalls wirste mich ab dem {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}}
des nächsten Monats nicht mehr
so schnell zu Gesicht bekommen!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
Aber ich brauche dich!
Mach's gut!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hah!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I get it.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} You're playing it cool.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 
Trying your best not to cry.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} It's OK.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Do NOT start blubbering!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} It's not
like we can never visit each other!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well, I gotta go plan my big move.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
See ya around, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ho capito la tua tattica.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Fai finta di niente.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ma trattieni
le lacrime.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Sai cosa? Va bene così.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Fammi un favore, non piangere!!!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Mica vado su Saturno?! Beh, anche
se non sarebbe tanto male...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ora vado a fare una lista di tutte
le cose da portare.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ci vediamo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hah!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Anladım.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Hiç bozuntuya vermiyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ağlamamak için kendini tutuyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Sorun
yok.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ama sakın hüngür hüngür ağlama!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Birbirimizi bir daha hiç göremeyecek
değiliz ya!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neyse, büyük taşınmayı
planlamam lazım.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Görüşürüz, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
